# The image builds its own runtime from the pin files, so a local venv, a local install's data
# and VCS metadata are all context nobody reads.
# A layer is immutable, so a secret copied into one survives being deleted later and travels
# with any export of the image. Compose reads .env from here without it ever entering the build.
.env
.git
.jj
.local
.venv*
dist
selly-data
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
*.egg-info
